# CQ7: Which pizzas cost less than 10 euros?
PREFIX rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#>
PREFIX rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>
PREFIX pizza: <https://ebrahimnorouzi.github.io/pizza-ontology/pizza.owl#>
PREFIX pr: <http://www.ontologydesignpatterns.org/cp/owl/price.owl#>
SELECT ?pizza ?amount WHERE {
  ?item pr:hasPrice ?price ; rdfs:label ?pizza .
  ?price pr:hasValue ?amount ; pr:hasCurrency pizza:euro .
  FILTER (?amount < 10)
} ORDER BY ?amount
